---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE, pgpGrouped } from '../site.config';
---

<Base title="Contact" description="Security reports, vendor coordination and assessment inquiries: email, PGP key and fingerprint.">
  <article class="prose">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
      <h1>Get in touch</h1>
      <p class="lede">For security reports, vendor coordination and assessment inquiries.</p>
    </header>

    <dl class="facts facts-2">
      <div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></dd></div>
      <div><dt>PGP key</dt><dd><a href="/pgp.asc">/pgp.asc</a></dd></div>
      <div class="facts-wide"><dt>Fingerprint</dt><dd><span class="fingerprint">{pgpGrouped}</span></dd></div>
      <div><dt>GitHub</dt><dd><a href={SITE.github} rel="me">{SITE.github.replace('https://', '')}</a></dd></div>
      <div><dt>security.txt</dt><dd><a href="/.well-known/security.txt">/.well-known/security.txt</a></dd></div>
    </dl>

    <h2>Vendors</h2>
    <p>If you've received a report from me, please reply to the same thread. Encrypted email is preferred for anything containing technical detail. My process and timelines are in the <a href="/disclosure-policy/">disclosure policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Assessment inquiries</h2>
    <p>Tell me what the product is, what you want assessed and your timeline. I'll reply with scope questions, and with a quote once the scope is clear. Please do not send binaries, source code, credentials or confidential material until a scope, written authorization and any NDA are in place. The <a href="/services/">services page</a> explains how an engagement runs.</p>

    <h2>Encrypted email</h2>
    <p>My public key is at <a href="/pgp.asc">/pgp.asc</a>. Check it against the fingerprint above before you use it. If you don't use PGP, send a first message without technical detail and we'll agree on a channel.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
